      "key": "89",
      "level": "1",
      "text": "Broacast发送接收原理",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "92",
      "level": "2",
      "text": "﻿https://www.jianshu.com/p/c5323a22f3f3﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "99",
      "level": "2",
      "text": "﻿https://blog.csdn.net/houliang120/article/details/51607170﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "106",
      "level": "2",
      "text": "﻿https://www.cnblogs.com/Robin132929/p/13804724.html﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "113",
      "level": "2",
      "text": "﻿https://gityuan.com/2016/06/04/broadcast-receiver/﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "120",
      "level": "2",
      "text": "有序广播发送后，在LoadAPK中调用receiver.performReceive方法后，再调finishReceiver来表明当前广播接收器已经处理了此广播，此广播结束：",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "123",
      "level": null,
      "text": "                  ﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "130",
      "level": null,
      "text": "finish()方法为PendingResult中的方法，内部调用逻辑：",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "133",
      "level": null,
      "text": "finish()--->sendFinish() --->再调用AMS的finishReceiver()--->再调用BroadcastQueue中finishReceiverLocked():",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "136",
      "level": null,
      "text": "最终表明当前广播处理完毕的逻辑都在finishReceiverLocked()中，",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "139",
      "level": null,
      "text": "﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
