    {
      "key": "236",
      "level": "1",
      "text": "﻿https://gityuan.com/2017/04/02/android-application/ (理解Application创建过程)",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "243",
      "level": "1",
      "text": "﻿https://blog.csdn.net/fei20121106/article/details/106444872（Android LoadedApk详解）",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "250",
      "level": null,
      "text": "由ActivityThread中getPackageinfo方法中创建实例。",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "253",
      "level": null,
      "text": "application创建：",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "256",
      "level": null,
      "text": "LoadedApk.makeApplication ---> Instrumentation.newApplication()",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "259",
      "level": null,
      "text": "﻿",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "262",
      "level": null,
      "text": "Apk的各种资源路径，文件路径等都会被LoadedApk对象持有：",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "265",
      "level": "3",
      "text": "appDir",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "268",
      "level": "3",
      "text": "libDir",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "271",
      "level": null,
      "text": "       LoadedApk也会创建各种类加载器，比如用于加载共享库的ClassLoader",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "key": "274",
      "level": null,
